  "objective": "Create the smallest generic Workspace runtime registry/selector seam so the platform can expose and select between the accepted independent Workspaces TIPA and shwtp, preserving strict runtime/session isolation and without UI yet. Deterministic enumeration; TIPA -> accepted 6-sub-line ASSY session factory; shwtp -> accepted G21/G22 session factory; selecting a Workspace creates/returns a session for that Workspace only; no shared state/run_id/clock/scenario/truth across Workspaces; switching never mutates/merges/reuses the inactive session; unknown/ambiguous id fails closed; registry is orchestration/platform metadata only; no cross-workspace CompositionGraph edge or runtime coupling; deterministic ordering independent of registration order; architecture open for future Workspaces; G22 semantics unchanged. Backend/platform selection only (prepares a future G24 workspace selector/UI).",
